1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,600
"Just five more minutes."

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
You fell asleep with the phone in your hand.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,900
And the minutes kept going.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,900
You woke up.

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Something felt... wrong.

6
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,400
Your hands were shaking.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:43,000
You were 80.

8
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:50,300
What if you woke up at 80?

9
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:56,600
2081.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,600
The world had moved on.

11
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:10,000
Without you.

12
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,500
Everything you meant to see... you missed.

13
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:26,400
Your best friend's house had a new name on the door.

14
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,200
You tried to run.

15
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:37,000
Like you always planned to.

16
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:47,500
You tried to play. Your fingers wouldn't listen.

17
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,400
You called Mom.

18
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:13,000
All the photos you never took.

19
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:20,500
Twenty-one years. On a screen.

20
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,400
A kid sat down next to you.

21
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,000
"Mister... what's the best part of life?"

22
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:44,500
"Everything you keep postponing."

23
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,400
You woke up.

24
00:02:56,400 --> 00:03:01,000
25. It was 6 AM.

25
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:09,900
It was just a dream. You still had time.

26
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:18,900
"Mom? I'm coming this Sunday."

27
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:24,900
You ran. Because you could.

28
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:30,900
You played. Because you still can.

29
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:40,900
And you sat with her. Just sat.

30
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:47,400
You won't wake up at 80 tomorrow.

31
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:53,400
But you will someday.

32
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:00,600
Make it worth remembering.

